        <p class="adt-body text-left leading-relaxed">
          <span data-id="pg088_n0008">Buna, shoqja e klas&#xeb;s s&#xeb; Jonit dhe Drinit, kishte organizuar dasm&#xeb;n e motr&#xeb;s n&#xeb; sht&#xeb;pin&#xeb; e saj.</span> <span data-id="pg088_n0009">Po martohej motra e saj dhe ajo kishte d&#xeb;shir&#xeb; t&#xeb; ftonte shok&#xeb;t dhe shoqet e klas&#xeb;s, q&#xeb; disa t&#xeb; mbanin fustanin e nuses e t&#xeb; tjer&#xeb;t lule.</span> <span data-id="pg088_n0010">Ajo, bashk&#xeb; me prind&#xeb;rit e v&#xeb;llez&#xeb;rit e saj, kishin p&#xeb;rgatitur sht&#xeb;pin&#xeb;, duke zbukuruar dhom&#xeb;n e ndenjjes dhe kishin p&#xeb;rgatitur &#xeb;mb&#xeb;lsira e ushqime nga m&#xeb; t&#xeb; ndryshmet.</span> <span data-id="pg088_n0011">Nd&#xeb;rkoh&#xeb; q&#xeb; Joni po p&#xeb;rgatitej p&#xeb;r dasm&#xeb;, n&#xeb;na iu afrua dhe po i tregonte se sa e r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sishme ishte q&#xeb; t&#xeb; respektonte familjen e Bun&#xeb;s dhe p&#xeb;rgatitjet e tyre p&#xeb;r dasm&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id="pg088_n0012">N&#xeb;na po tregonte se sa e r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sishme ishte q&#xeb; ai t&#xeb; shkonte n&#xeb; orarin e caktuar te sht&#xeb;pia e shoqes s&#xeb; tij.</span> <span data-id="pg088_n0013">Ajo, gjithashtu, i tha se duhej t&#xeb; mendonte q&#xeb; t&#x2019;i b&#xeb;nte edhe nj&#xeb; dhurat&#xeb;, e cila do ta g&#xeb;zonte shum&#xeb; at&#xeb;, pasi t&#xeb; gjith&#xeb; b&#xeb;jn&#xeb; dhurata n&#xeb; raste t&#xeb; tilla.</span> <span data-id="pg088_n0014">Sa gj&#xeb;ra t&#xeb; bukura m&#xeb;soi Joni!</span> <span data-id="pg088_n0015">Ai p&#xeb;rjetoi emocione t&#xeb; shumta, t&#xeb; cilat nuk do t&#x2019;i harroj&#xeb; kurr&#xeb;.</span>
